[0.0, "o", "Investigating REAL data for tenant \u2588\u2588\u2588\u2588\u2588\u2588\u2588\u2588\u2588: can you check hubspot and tell me the closed won rate in the last 3 months?\r\n\u001b[2m2026-09-23 13:09:41\u001b[0m [\u001b[33m\u001b[1mwarning  \u001b[0m] \u001b[1mmcp.nothing_admissible        \u001b[0m \u001b[36mlabel\u001b[0m=\u001b[35mposthog\u001b[0m \u001b[36mreason\u001b[0m=\u001b[35m'the server was queried and offered no tool Cortex can admit; every tool must declare readOnlyHint: true'\u001b[0m\r\nRead-only: no write capability exists in the tool registry.\r\nCapabilities available to \u2588\u2588\u2588\u2588\u2588\u2588\u2588\u2588\u2588: github, hubspot, posthog, slack\r\n  [  0.1s]          checking what data exists\r\n  [ 12.1s]          found posthog__list_projects\r\n  [ 12.1s]          checking memory for prior context\r\n  [ 21.1s] step 1   deciding what to look at\r\n  [ 25.3s] step 1   calling hubspot__closed_won\r\n  [ 25.3s] step 1   calling hubspot__search\r\n  [ 25.3s] step 1   calling hubspot__search\r\n  [ 27.9s] step 1   got hubspot__closed_won (2 observation(s) so far)\r\n  [ 27.9s] step 1   got hubspot__search (3 observation(s) so far)\r\n  [ 27.9s] step 1   got hubspot__search (4 observation(s) so far)\r\n  [ 27.9s] step 2   deciding what to look at\r\n  [ 33.6s] step 2   got read hubspot.search in full (65 rows) (4 observation(s) so far)\r\n  [ 33.6s] step 3   deciding what to look at\r\n  [ 58.9s]          drafting the report from 4 observation(s)\r\n  [ 72.1s]          checking every citation resolves\r\n  [ 72.1s]          re-reading each claim against its own evidence\r\n  sufficiency gate: skipped, this report asserts no cause (0.0s)\r\n  [ 83.2s]          writing the report\r\n\r\n==============================================================================\r\nQ: Can you check HubSpot and tell me the closed-won rate in the last 3 months?\r\n==============================================================================\r\n\r\nConfidence: low\r\nTook 72s over 3 steps, 34,889 tokens, 4 observations gathered, 2 cited\r\n\r\nANSWER\r\n------------------------------------------------------------------------------\r\n  The closed-won rate for the last \u2588 months (2026-06-23 to 2026-09-23) is \u2588\u2588.\u2588% by deal count (\u2588 won vs. \u2588\u2588 lost) or \u2588\u2588.\u2588% by dollar value ($\u2588\u2588\u2588,\u2588\u2588\u2588 won vs. $\u2588,\u2588\u2588\u2588,\u2588\u2588\u2588 lost).  [hubspot.closed_won 55ce7d64, hubspot.search bdce797e]\r\n\r\nFINDINGS\r\n------------------------------------------------------------------------------\r\n  Closed-won rate, last \u2588 months (2026-06-23 to 2026-09-23)  (high)\r\n    - \u2588 deals closed won and \u2588\u2588 deals closed lost in the window, giving a win rate of \u2588\u2588.\u2588% by count.  [hubspot.closed_won 55ce7d64, hubspot.search bdce797e]\r\n    - By dollar value, closed-won deals total $\u2588\u2588\u2588,\u2588\u2588\u2588 against $\u2588,\u2588\u2588\u2588,\u2588\u2588\u2588 closed lost, a win rate of \u2588\u2588.\u2588% by amount.  [hubspot.closed_won 55ce7d64, hubspot.search bdce797e]\r\n\r\nRISKS AND CAVEATS\r\n------------------------------------------------------------------------------\r\n  - Several closed-won deals (e.g. \u2588\u2588\u2588\u2588\u2588\u2588\u2588, \u2588\u2588\u2588\u2588\u2588\u2588\u2588\u2588\u2588\u2588, \u2588\u2588\u2588\u2588\u2588\u2588\u2588\u2588\u2588\u2588\u2588, \u2588\u2588\u2588\u2588, \u2588\u2588\u2588\u2588\u2588\u2588 \u2588\u2588\u2588\u2588\u2588\u2588) share an identical close_date of 2026-06-30T04:00:00Z and created_at timestamps from January, suggesting a batch/import artifact rather than deals genuinely closing on that date \u2014 this could slightly distort the exact timing distribution, though it does not change the win/loss totals used here.\r\n  - \u2588 claim(s) were removed because an independent check found the cited evidence did not support them. Treat the remaining conclusions with corresponding caution.\r\n\r\nDATA QUALITY\r\n------------------------------------------------------------------------------\r\n  - Rate is computed only over deals with a closedate in the window (closed won + closed lost); it excludes still-open pipeline deals, so it reflects the resolution rate of deals that closed in this period, not overall pipeline conversion.\r\n  - The github commits sync last succeeded \u2588\u2588 days ago. Stored history for it is that old, and a recent change may not appear.\r\n  - The github deployments sync last succeeded \u2588\u2588 days ago. Stored history for it is that old, and a recent change may not appear.\r\n  - The github issues sync last succeeded \u2588\u2588 days ago. Stored history for it is that old, and a recent change may not appear.\r\n  - The github links sync last succeeded \u2588\u2588 days ago. Stored history for it is that old, and a recent change may not appear.\r\n  - The posthog annotations sync last succeeded \u2588\u2588 days ago. Stored history for it is that old, and a recent change may not appear.\r\n  - The posthog events sync last succeeded \u2588\u2588 days ago. Stored history for it is that old, and a recent change may not appear.\r\n\r\nSOURCES\r\n------------------------------------------------------------------------------\r\n  55ce7d64  hubspot.closed_won  hubspot://crm/v3/objects/deals/search?closed_won=2026-06-23..2026-09-23\r\n  bdce797e  hubspot.search  hubspot://crm/v3/objects/deals/search?closedate=2026-06-23..2026-09-23&hs_is_closed_lost=true\r\n\r\nphase breakdown (83s wall, 81s measured)\r\n  phase        calls  seconds  share    mean  tokens\r\n  survey           1     12.1   15%    12.1  in 0 out 0\r\n  recall           1      8.9   11%     8.9  in 0 out 0\r\n  loop_model       3     35.2   42%    11.7  in 6 out 2,586 cached 20,252\r\n  loop_tools       2      2.6    3%     1.3  in 0 out 0\r\n  draft            1     13.2   16%    13.2  in 31,180 out 1,117\r\n  